 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.52,
   "text": "Your four o'clock coffee is still in you at bedtime. You can probably still fall asleep."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.78,
   "e": 9.28,
   "text": "That's not the problem. There's one time on the clock that fixes this and most people never said"
  },
  {
   "s": 9.28,
   "e": 14.26,
   "text": "it. Here's the math. Caffeine takes about five hours to drop by half. A cup at four, at nine,"
  },
  {
   "s": 14.46,
   "e": 19.02,
   "text": "half of it is still in you. At two in the morning, a quarter. So you sleep, but caffeine can keep"
  },
  {
   "s": 19.02,
   "e": 24.06,
   "text": "that sleep lighter. You wake up tired and you reach for another coffee. So where's the line?"
  },
  {
   "s": 24.48,
   "e": 30.14,
   "text": "Take your bedtime and count back eight hours. Bed at 11, your cutoff is 3 p.m. After that,"
  },
  {
   "s": 30.26,
   "e": 35.1,
   "text": "it's decaf or nothing. And when the four o'clock slump hits, take a 10-minute walk outside instead."
  },
  {
   "s": 35.6,
   "e": 40.22,
   "text": "It wakes you up and it doesn't follow you to bed. Swap just that one cup. And at bedtime,"
  },
  {
   "s": 40.22,
   "e": 44.64,
   "text": "you're down from half a cup to about an eighth. Here's the rule. Bedtime minus eight hours."
  },
  {
   "s": 45.02,
   "e": 49.28,
   "text": "Decaf after that. A walk for the slump. Send this to the friend who orders a latte at five."
  },
  {
   "s": 49.28,
   "e": 53.98,
   "text": "That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "s": 53.98,
   "e": 58.82,
   "text": "and break it down into small steps you can actually do. Follow for one fix a day for the"
  },
  {
   "s": 58.82,
   "e": 63.0,
   "text": "things that keep stalling. Tomorrow, what to do when it's still dark when you wake up."
  },
  {
   "s": 63.4,
   "e": 65.9,
   "text": "If you want to try it out, I've put the link in the bio."
  }
 ],
 "wps": 3.72
}